<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" viewBox="0 0 1280 480" width="1280" height="480" role="img" aria-label="Security toolchain"><title>Security toolchain</title><desc>Security tools riding three tilted elliptical orbits around a glowing shield core, plus a grouped grid: detection and SIEM, red team and VAPT, cloud and network, custom tooling.</desc><defs><style>@font-face{font-family:'SG';src:url(data:font/woff2;base64,__FONT_SG__) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:'SGM';src:url(data:font/woff2;base64,__FONT_SGM__) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:'JBM';src:url(data:font/woff2;base64,__FONT_JBM__) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:'JBMB';src:url(data:font/woff2;base64,__FONT_JBMB__) format('woff2')}
